# ALLIANCE. New Forever dungeon. Source: foreverchanges.pro/dungeons/shapers-terrace and quest pages (level range is Blizzard's).
@dungeon Shaper's Terrace
@levels 58-60
@window 56-60
@best 58
@hub Un'Goro Crater, 45.0, 8.0, 10
@hub Stormwind City, 50.0, 50.0
@hub Ironforge, 50.0, 50.0
@hub Eastern Plaguelands, 81.0, 59.0, 8
@hub Western Plaguelands, 43.0, 84.0, 8
@entrance none
RUN @ Un'Goro Crater, 56, 12 | New Forever dungeon, not checked in game yet. It is in the hills of Un'Goro Crater; the entrance is reported by the northern pylon at about 56, 12. Curator Thorius in the Hall of Explorers in Ironforge (71.5, 15.7) gives both Alliance quests, Panic at the Digsite and Mapping the Way Forward (from level 55). Take what is offered; the addon logs it so these steps can be filled in.
